# los-tv: GPU PCI device attributes (vendor/device/uevent) are read by Mesa
# inside app processes to pick the hardware driver (radeonsi/i915).  The
# generic sysfs label denies that, so apps fell back to llvmpipe (software)
# and the whole UI crawled.  Label the GPU PCI functions as sysfs_gpu;
# appdomain already has read-only access to sysfs_gpu.
genfscon sysfs /devices/pci0000:00/0000:00:01.0 u:object_r:sysfs_gpu:s0
genfscon sysfs /devices/pci0000:00/0000:00:02.0 u:object_r:sysfs_gpu:s0
